<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86291" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβ-ευτής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ambassador,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.22.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				941a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				933.31
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβευταί</span> is at first less freq., later more freq.,
			than 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέσβεις, πρεσβευτὰς πάντας ὑμᾶς
					ἡμεῖς οἱ πρέσβεις ποιοῦμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					3.41
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.77
			</span></i> (interpol.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.858.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				1224.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>agent</i> or <i>commissioner,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					45.64
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			= Lat. <i>legatus, staff officer,</i> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				35.4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ἀντιστράτηγος,</span>
			=
			<i>legatus pro praetore,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				14.1121
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
